[en.DECISION_C01_PURSUE_YEARLING]
Puresue A.K. Yearling

[en.DECISION_C01_PURSUE_YEARLING_desc]
The Empire Ministry of Order will actively pursue the author A.K. Yearling of the banned book The Griffon Lies Heavy, to reduce the instability caused by the publication of the book.

[zh.DECISION_C01_PURSUE_YEARLING]
追捕AK·伊尔琳

[zh.DECISION_C01_PURSUE_YEARLING_desc]
帝国秩序部将积极追捕禁书《沉重的狮鹫》作者AK·伊尔琳，以降低禁书出版带来的不稳定影响。
